	(text "SMS / SMS2 50-pin cartridge edge, drawn by function (finger numbers on the pins).\nOdd pins face even pins (2k-1 over 2k).  ASSUMED, verify on a real cart PCB: odd pins on the\ncomponent side, pin 1 at the RIGHT seen from that side with the fingers down.\nUnused console outputs (left) are open.  /CONT and /BUSREQ end on test pads TP5 / TP6 only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
